<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - AstroGuide</title>
    <style>
        :root { --bg-deep: #0b0c10; --bg-card: #1f2833; --accent-gold: #c5a059; --accent-cyan: #66fcf1; --text-main: #c5c6c7; --text-light: #ffffff; --text-muted: #86888a; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg-deep); color: var(--text-main); min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 80px; position: relative; }
        header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #12161a 0%, #1f2833 100%); padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-gold); }
        header h1 { color: var(--text-light); text-transform: uppercase; }
        header h1 span { color: var(--accent-gold); }
        nav { margin-top: 15px; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; }
        nav a { color: var(--text-main); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        nav a:hover, nav a.active { color: var(--accent-cyan); }
        main { max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
        .content-box { background-color: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        h2 { color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 20px; }
        h3 { color: var(--accent-gold); margin: 20px 0 10px 0; }
        p { margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
        footer { background-color: #12161a; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; padding: 20px; position: absolute; bottom: 0; width: 100%; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Astro<span>Guide</span></h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="index.html">Home App</a>
            <a href="about.html">About Our Work</a>
            <a href="terms.html">Terms of Service</a>
            <a href="privacy.html" class="active">Privacy Policy</a>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <main>
        <div class="content-box">
            <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p><strong>Last Updated: October 2026</strong></p>
            <p>At AstroGuide, owned and operated by Nancy Bellinger, we are committed to safeguarding the data privacy of our users.</p>
            
            <h3>1. Information Collected</h3>
            <p>When using our free birth tools, we capture the data inputs required for the calculating engine (birth date, time, and signs). We also collect your email address via our lead gate mechanism to deliver user results and build our commercial mailing database.</p>
            
            <h3>2. Data Utilization</h3>
            <p>Your email address is strictly used to deliver requested services, process paid reports, and communicate occasional marketing offers. We will never sell, distribute, or lease your private contact information to third-party brokers.</p>
            
            <h3>3. Opt-Out Protections</h3>
            <p>Subscribers reserve the absolute right to opt out of our email list at any time by clicking the "Unsubscribe" button included at the base of our marketing transmissions.</p>
        </div>
    </main>
    <footer>&copy; 2026 Nancy Bellinger. All Rights Reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>
